{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39489","headline":"途次绩溪先寄陈明府 · 张蠙","name":"途次绩溪先寄陈明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"入境风烟好，幽人不易传。\n新居多是客，旧隐半成仙。\n山断云冲骑，溪长柳拂船。\n何当许过县，闻有箧中篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张蠙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39489.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39489","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}